### =====================================================================
### Dressa API - kumpulan request untuk ekstensi REST Client
###
### Cara pakai:
###   1. Pastikan api-gateway (npm run dev:api) dan ml-engine (uvicorn) sedang jalan.
###   2. Klik tulisan "Send Request" yang muncul di atas setiap request.
###   3. Hasilnya muncul di panel sebelah kanan.
###
### Jalankan berurutan dari atas: request "createUser" menyimpan id user,
### lalu request lain memakainya otomatis lewat {{userId}}.
### =====================================================================

@base = http://localhost:3000
@ml = http://localhost:8000
@userId = {{createUser.response.body.$.id}}


### 0. Cek server hidup
GET {{base}}/health

### 0b. Cek ml-engine (attribute_model "ml-classifier" kalau dressa_ml.joblib sudah dipasang)
GET {{ml}}/health


### 1. Buat user uji (kalau email sudah ada, user yang sama dikembalikan)
# @name createUser
POST {{base}}/dev/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "saya@dressa.test",
  "displayName": "Saya"
}


### 2. Lihat profil
GET {{base}}/me
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 3. Atur lokasi untuk cuaca (contoh: Jakarta). Ganti sesuai kotamu.
PATCH {{base}}/me
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": -6.2,
  "longitude": 106.8,
  "timezone": "Asia/Jakarta"
}


### 4. Upload foto baju.
###    Ganti path setelah tanda "<" dengan lokasi foto di laptopmu.
###    Proses ini butuh sekitar 5-10 detik (hapus background + tagging).
###    Ganti juga "image/jpeg" jadi "image/png" kalau fotonya PNG.
# @name uploadItem
POST {{base}}/items
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DressaBoundary

--DressaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="baju.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< C:\Users\NathanLampoenk2\Pictures\baju.jpg
--DressaBoundary--


### 5. Daftar semua baju di lemari
GET {{base}}/items
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 5b. Hanya atasan (pilihan lain: BOTTOM, OUTERWEAR, DRESS, FOOTWEAR, ACCESSORY)
GET {{base}}/items?category=TOP
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 6. Koreksi tag baju yang terakhir di-upload (kalau tebakan model salah)
PATCH {{base}}/items/{{uploadItem.response.body.$.item.id}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemType": "shirt",
  "styles": ["casual"]
}


### 7. Rekomendasi outfit hari ini
# @name reco
GET {{base}}/recommendations
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 7b. Alternatif berikutnya (reroll)
GET {{base}}/recommendations?reroll=1
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 7c. Isi tipe agenda manual (formal / casual / sport), tanpa Google Calendar
GET {{base}}/recommendations?eventType=formal
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 7d. Eksperimen bobot (contoh: cuaca lebih penting, rotasi kurang penting)
GET {{base}}/recommendations?wWeather=0.5&wRotation=0.1
X-User-Id: {{userId}}


### 8. Catat bahwa outfit rekomendasi pertama dari request 7 dipakai hari ini.
###    Jalankan request 7 dulu. Kalau outfit-nya berisi 2 item, hapus baris id ketiga.
# @name wear
POST {{base}}/outfits
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemIds": [
    "{{reco.response.body.$.outfits[0].items[0].id}}",
    "{{reco.response.body.$.outfits[0].items[1].id}}",
    "{{reco.response.body.$.outfits[0].items[2].id}}"
  ],
  "recommended": true
}

### 9. Riwayat outfit
GET {{base}}/outfits
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 10. Batalkan catatan pemakaian terakhir (request 8)
DELETE {{base}}/outfits/{{wear.response.body.$.id}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}


### 11. Status Google Calendar (opsional)
GET {{base}}/integrations/google
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 12. Minta link login Google, lalu buka "url" di respons pakai browser
GET {{base}}/integrations/google/auth-url
X-User-Id: {{userId}}


### 13. Hapus baju yang terakhir di-upload
DELETE {{base}}/items/{{uploadItem.response.body.$.item.id}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
